              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خان الوزير الملك في القصة. khāna al-wazīr al-malik fī al-qiṣṣa. In the story the minister betrayed the king."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present: يخون, yakhūn."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Not the noun خان (khāna), an inn, which has another source."
            }
          ]
        },
