          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خان (khāna) is built on the native Arabic root kh-w-n (Lane), \"to be unfaithful to a trust\"; khiyāna is treachery."
            }
          ]
